From: Tiaoge-tou <85100527+Tiaoge-tou@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 18:06:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Probe: return to the shell library in-process
 (DM_PROBE_RETURN)

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: Probe build only: the three-finger close freezes the guest, runs the ordered teardown without its exit, and hands the window back to a fresh library with every start guard re-armed, so a second game can start in the same process. Never on main; the probe measures what the abandoned threads and mappings break.
Issue: Tiaoge-tou/NX2Apple PROJECT.md probe: in-process return to library

