+void dm_profile_reload(void);   // Probe: forget the loaded profile; the next dm_profile() loads again from DM_PROFILE (a second game in the same process brings its own)
 void dm_profile_log(void);
 // The same pointer, cached per translation unit: for the hot paths (per draw, per texture) that cannot afford the function call.
